    "article_paragraphs": [
      {
        "number": 1,
        "text": "Pip wants his red ball. \"Woof!\" says Pip. Tom and Lily are in the garden. \"Where is the ball?\" asks Tom. \"Let's look!\" says Lily. Oh no!"
      },
      {
        "number": 2,
        "text": "There is a blue box. Tom looks in the box. Not here. There is a green box. Lily looks in the box. She finds a yellow toy. Not here. Pip is small. He is not happy. Oh dear!"
      },
      {
        "number": 3,
        "text": "\"Look!\" says Lily. \"Is it under the tree?\" \"Yes, it is!\" says Tom. Pip runs to it. The red ball is under the tree! \"Woof, woof!\" says Pip. \"Hooray!\" says Lily. Pip is happy again."
      }
